s. This draft is meant to accompany that future discussion, as it showcases the overall scope of a total conversion. While this would affect virtually every non-thirdparty header in the repo, the scope is isolated to such an extent that it can be safely excluded via `.git-blame-ignore-revs`. Changes to non-header files — builders, pre-commit, etc — were handled in a separate commit which would *not* be excluded. Does not convert headers for `*-so_wrap.h` files (generated externally), ~~nor ObjC files (guards shouldn't be there in the first place, but removing them is out-of-scope; handled in #101174 instead)~~.\r\n\r\n**EDIT:** Now also includes ObjC files, as their compilers also handle `#pragma once` just fine. Having them included means that the logic for checking header guards has been reduced significantly.","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097162,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTcxNjI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/discussion","name":"discussion","description":"","color":"ccaaff","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097966,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc5NjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:core","name":"topic:core","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098009,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgwMDk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:buildsystem","name":"topic:buildsystem","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2304948121,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyMzA0OTQ4MTIx","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:codestyle","name":"topic:codestyle","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"arc